<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak cbank forex reserves fall to $2.7 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak cbank forex reserves fall to $2.7 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Friday its foreign exchange reserves had fallen to $2.7 billion as of June 4 compared with $3.1 billion on May 28.</p>
</text>
